[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0010","text":"咲耶，辛苦了\n今天也拜托了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0020","text":"咦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0030","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0040","text":"（睡得真沉啊……\n　看来确实是累了吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0050","text":"……再多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0060","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0070","text":"……一起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0080","text":"（…………时间还来得及\n　再让她多睡一会儿吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0090","text":"（我也在边上休息一下吧────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010600_03_0100","text":"……嗯……\n好温暖……"}]
